WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:05.083
So we just arrived in Busan

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.833
and we just immediately 
checked into our accommodation

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:11.041
which is in Gwangalli beach. 

00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:14.083
It's a pretty popular location

00:02:14.208 --> 00:02:16.083
at least amongst locals here.

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:17.916
And I have to say this is

00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:23.041
the prettiest Airbnb accommodation in Busan.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:27.500
It has a gorgeous gorgeous view 
of the Gwangan bridge 

00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:30.916
which lights up in the evening hours.
I'm going to show you guys later.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.500
I think that if you come to Busan

00:02:32.583 --> 00:02:34.416
you really want to at
least stay maybe 

00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:38.083
either the entire duration or
at least a couple of nights

00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:42.291
staying near a beach gives that 
sort of essential Busan vibe. 

00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:45.875
I think most people tend 
to drift towards Haundae.

00:02:45.875 --> 00:02:50.791
I would arguably say that Gwangalli beach 
is the better place to stay in my opinion.

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.375
Definitely more the local hot spot.

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:55.250
We decided to stay here 
because of the bridge view of course

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.625
and this lovely accommodation 

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:01.041
that we're gonna enjoy for 
the next two nights.

00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:04.000
So we're gonna head down 
try to find some food. 

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.083
We're a little bit hungry.

00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:09.833
There's a nice little pizza spot that 
I've found with a nice beer as well so

00:03:10.291 --> 00:03:11.583
yeah looking forward to that.

00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:12.500
Let's go.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.125
We just arrived at the SOL Taphouse.

00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:27.875
This is a little small pizza joint.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:28.666
I ordered a beer.

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:31.041
Lisa ordered a cider.

00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:33.083
And we just ordered a bunch of 

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.875
half pizzas.

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:36.000
Place looks really good.

00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:36.875
The beer is really good.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.666
So I'm very much
expecting a lot from the pizza.

00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:43.208
I'm starving and
can't wait to get started.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.291
Our pizza has arrived.

00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:57.125
let's get a bite.

00:04:01.041 --> 00:04:01.541
Oh yeah.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:04.833
Hits the spot.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.250
Just hits the spot.

00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:06.875
Just right.

00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:25.208
So I should write one to you, 
and you will write one to me

00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:25.708
Yes.

00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:26.458
OK, OK, OK.

00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:29.208
I'll write a long message.

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:30.875
It will be sent in 2024.

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:31.750
2024?

00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:34.833
By that time, I won't remember 
what I wrote to you

00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:36.416
That's what makes it fun.

00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:21.916
All right, we are on the Blue Line

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.541
train or a capsule, sky capsule.

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:30.333
Going at like grandma walking pace, 
I would probably call it.

00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:33.625
But it provides excellent view of the ocean.

00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:35.000
And I would definitely recommend

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.833
go from Mipo to Cheongsapo.

00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:39.333
That's how you get the ocean view.

00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:41.375
You could go the other way of course, 

00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:44.958
but obviously you're gonna
get blocked by incoming capsules.

00:06:45.041 --> 00:06:47.083
It's also a lot less busy

00:06:47.083 --> 00:06:50.375
so there's definitely a bigger chance 
for you to book a ticket

00:06:51.041 --> 00:06:51.958
especially from that direction

00:06:52.041 --> 00:06:53.625
compared to Mipo

00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:54.958
which is a lot more popular.

00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:16.083
And now we're headed to a museum, 

00:10:16.083 --> 00:10:17.125
an art museum.

00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:19.333
Resembles a little bit of teamLab's 

00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:22.458
digital art displays in Japan.

00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:31.291
All right, so we just came out 
of the art museum. 

00:11:31.291 --> 00:11:33.625
It's called Museum One or Won.

00:11:33.833 --> 00:11:36.208
That's what it says on Naver, 
but I think it's Museum One.

00:11:36.625 --> 00:11:37.916
And it was nice. 

00:11:37.916 --> 00:11:41.458
We were there like
around 10, 11 AM.

00:11:41.458 --> 00:11:42.833
There wasn't a lot of people around

00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:45.625
so pretty much had the place 
almost all to ourselves.

00:11:45.625 --> 00:11:47.416
Only a couple of people,
so it was really nice. 

00:11:47.416 --> 00:11:50.375
But then when we just went outside, 
there was like buses 

00:11:50.583 --> 00:11:53.250
coming in with like kids
and everything like that.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.625
So you wanna go there and get a lot
of nice photo opportunities. 

00:11:55.833 --> 00:11:59.291
Definitely get here pretty early as
soon as they open, I would say.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.333
But other than that, I
think it was a pretty cool place.

00:12:02.583 --> 00:12:04.333
And our bus is coming, I think.

00:12:04.833 --> 00:12:05.458
No, it's not.

00:12:05.458 --> 00:12:06.000
Maybe? 

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:06.791
Okay, it is.

00:13:10.791 --> 00:13:12.791
It's not quite what I expected. 

00:13:12.791 --> 00:13:13.625
I mean, it's okay.

00:13:13.666 --> 00:13:17.125
Like, it's not something I would
order every single time I see it, but...

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:19.416
Yeah that's alright.

00:13:19.416 --> 00:13:20.083
It's alright.

00:14:58.416 --> 00:15:00.083
Trying TAMS...

00:15:00.625 --> 00:15:01.666
for the first time...

00:15:06.666 --> 00:15:08.750
Mm, it's like Fanta, you know.

00:15:09.291 --> 00:15:10.083
It's like Fanta.

00:15:10.166 --> 00:15:11.166
It's good, recommended.

00:15:23.833 --> 00:15:24.750
You need to go faster.

00:16:11.166 --> 00:16:11.791
All right, all right.

00:16:11.791 --> 00:16:15.250
So we just went through 
the Running Man experience,

00:16:15.708 --> 00:16:17.541
and at first I thought it was probably

00:16:17.625 --> 00:16:19.166
gonna be a gimmicky kind of thing,

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.833
but honestly, I was surprised 
how fun it actually was.

00:16:21.916 --> 00:16:22.916
We really enjoyed our time.

00:16:23.541 --> 00:16:26.000
We were in there for like, what, 
two hours or something like that,

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.333
and it went by so, so fast.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.708
Yeah, we really wanted to play more,

00:16:30.791 --> 00:16:31.708
but we ran out of time.

00:16:32.333 --> 00:16:33.500
I definitely recommend it for you guys.

00:16:33.583 --> 00:16:35.958
If you're into games
and you have a couple of friends

00:16:36.166 --> 00:16:39.500
or with your a close loved
one, definitely just go there

00:16:39.583 --> 00:16:40.208
and try it.

00:16:40.208 --> 00:16:41.708
It's super fun, totally recommend it.

00:17:42.291 --> 00:17:44.666
Nothing feels more like you're in Busan

00:17:44.958 --> 00:17:46.833
than eating straight from the grill,

00:17:46.833 --> 00:17:49.208
right next to the pavement, basically.

00:17:49.625 --> 00:17:50.541
Prices are a little bit

00:17:51.291 --> 00:17:52.625
spiked here, I would say.

00:17:52.708 --> 00:17:53.875
Definitely an interesting experience.

00:17:53.958 --> 00:17:55.000
I think it's worth it 

00:17:55.375 --> 00:17:56.708
if you're here in Busan.

00:18:52.125 --> 00:18:53.916
We are in Jagalchi market.

00:18:53.916 --> 00:18:54.833
We just spent...

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.875
Half an hour walking around downstairs,

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.666
where you see all of
these different fish vendors,

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.875
trying to sell you things, 
trying to pull you in,

00:19:02.958 --> 00:19:04.833
trying to sweet talk you into buying things.

00:19:04.916 --> 00:19:06.708
And then after just checking things out,

00:19:06.791 --> 00:19:07.750
we decided to head upstairs

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.416
where you can find the restaurants,

00:19:09.708 --> 00:19:11.208
and this is where you can just go in

00:19:11.458 --> 00:19:15.125
and order through like a
a normal menu, basically.

00:19:15.458 --> 00:19:17.958
But you could also go
downstairs and buy the fish

00:19:18.208 --> 00:19:19.000
and then bring it up

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.875
and have these different 
restaurants cook it for you.

00:19:21.958 --> 00:19:22.791
Now, if you do that,

00:19:22.875 --> 00:19:25.000
obviously, it costs a little bit extra,

00:19:25.375 --> 00:19:27.291
but if you don't know what you want

00:19:27.375 --> 00:19:30.458
and you don't know like how
the dishes gonna come out,

00:19:30.541 --> 00:19:32.708
I recommend just
going up to the second floor.

00:19:32.916 --> 00:19:34.125
That's where all the restaurants are.

00:19:34.375 --> 00:19:36.458
You see a menu, you
can pick out what you want,

00:19:36.541 --> 00:19:37.666
it's a little bit cheaper.

00:19:38.041 --> 00:19:39.458
But of course, 
you don't get that experience

00:19:39.541 --> 00:19:42.750
of picking the individual
fish or shellfish that you want.

00:19:43.208 --> 00:19:44.500
Me and Lisa just decided to head up

00:19:44.666 --> 00:19:46.666
and just look at the menu

00:19:46.875 --> 00:19:48.708
We just wanna taste
a little bit of everything,

00:19:48.791 --> 00:19:49.500
a little bit of clams, 

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.166
a little bit of fish.

00:19:50.666 --> 00:19:54.041
Lisa been dying
to try a seafood pancake.

00:19:54.166 --> 00:19:55.125
So yeah,

00:19:55.125 --> 00:19:56.500
our food is about to come.

00:20:17.625 --> 00:20:18.333
Is it worth it?

00:20:18.875 --> 00:20:19.666
Is it worth it?

00:20:20.166 --> 00:20:20.958
Yes.

00:20:40.166 --> 00:20:42.083
This is pretty big.

00:20:42.416 --> 00:20:44.666
Looks absolutely delicious,

00:20:45.041 --> 00:20:46.041
grilled and everything, 

00:20:46.041 --> 00:20:46.833
gonna dip it in.

